          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Did you know that a dog's normal temperature ranges between 100 -102 °F? </strong>When it rises above 104 °F, your dog's health is at risk. </p><p><strong>Overheating</strong> can result in a <strong>faster heart rate</strong>, <strong>increased panting</strong> and <strong>drooling</strong>, and <strong>sweating</strong> through the paw pads. </p><p>By placing your dog on the Pelsbarn Cooling Mat, <strong>your dog can cool down 3 - 7 °F degrees within a few minutes</strong>. This makes it safe to use as your dog's body temperature will gradually drop.</p>",
